astrobench_eb380fd57f,astrobench_eb380fd57f_chunk_022,22,"Phase spirals across galactic disks I: Exploring dynamical influences on winding 3.ANALYSIS METHODS This section describes our methods for analyzing each simulation snapshot. Firstwe choose our coordinate sys tems (Section 3.1), then bin the data (Section 3.1.2), and finally quantify the propertiesof the phase spirals within each bin (Section 3.2). RG ≡ Jϕ vcirc(Jϕ) ≃8.2 kpc Jϕ 1900 kpckm/s 230 km/s vcirc (1) zmax ≃ 2Jzvz,max(Jz) ≃300 pc 2Jz 9 kpckm/s 30 km/svz,max (2)",3.ANALYSIS METHODS This section describes our methods for analyzing each,3.ANALYSIS METHODS This section describes our methods for analyzing each,,,,,Phase spirals across galactic disks I: Exploring dynamical influences on winding,"Kiyan Tavangar, Kathryn V. Johnston, Jason A. S. Hunt, Axel Widmark, Chris Hamilton, Michael S. Petersen, Martin D. Weinberg",astro-ph.GA,2026-03-24T18:00:00Z,http://arxiv.org/abs/2603.23588v1,2603.23588,galactic_dynamics,97,74,False,False,0,74,True,4.0
